### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.6.1.stable.arch_linux [14d19694e]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable (14d19694e) - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Mon, 09 Feb 2026 17:16:33 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (radeonsi, phoenix, LLVM 21.1.6, DRM 3.64, 6.18.9-arch1-2) - AMD Ryzen 7 8745HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads) - 28.18 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a378032-c531-42db-8cca-07fe4da18383\n\nThe tree does not expand when using the \"hide filtered out parents\" setting and \"auto expand to selected\" and selecting a node.\n\nOddly enough, searching a node that is just one level beyond a revealed node and selecting it does work:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7985ca72-1068-4d1b-a4a7-bec300cb6654\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Click the 3 dots next to the scene tree filter and enable \"auto expand to selected\" and \"hide filtered out parents\"\n2. Start the game\n3. Go to the remote tab \n4. Search a node name that is very nested\n5. Select the node\n6. Clear the search query\n7. The node is not revealed\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[nested_node_example_2026-02-26_08-59-04.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25577581/nested_node_example_2026-02-26_08-59-04.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116807/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116807/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}